    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-prov28">
        <head xml:id="gom-prov28-Hd1e98">Caput 28</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov28-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov28-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov28-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov28_1@1-2">Fugit impius.</quote>
            Qui non est fortis, etiam si nullus persequatur, sponte fidem deserit: dum latrociniis, vel perjuriis, aliisque hujusmodi infideli se similem reddit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov28-d1e110">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e112" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov28_1@5-8">Justus autem quasi leo.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e115"><seg type="qs">In occursu bestiarum non trepidat</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quem nemo invitus amittit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov28-Dd1e124">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov28-Hd1e126">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov28-d1e128">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e130" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov28_5@6-8">Qui autem requirunt.</quote>
            Omnia animadvertunt electi, id est et futurum discrimen universalis judicii; et quibus operibus requies; et quibus poena retribuatur aeterna.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov28-Dd1e135">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov28-Hd1e137">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov28-d1e139">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1111B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e143" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov28_10@1-5">Qui decipit justos in via mea,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e146"><seg type="qs">Qui per doctrinam haereticam decipit amatores justitiae</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">exemplum etiam de casu ejus sumunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov28-Dd1e155">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov28-Hd1e157">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov28-d1e159">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e161" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov28_12@1-2">In exsultatione,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e164"><seg type="qs">Non de praesentibus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quod et de paganis, et haereticis, et malis Catholicis potest accipi.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov28-Dd1e174">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov28-Hd1e176">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov28-d1e178">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e180" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov28_14@1-2">Beatus homo,</quote>
            etc. Ira judicii tanto districtior portabitur, quanto nunc minus timetur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov28-Dd1e185">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov28-Hd1e187">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov28-d1e189">
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e191" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov28_22@1-4">Vir qui festinat ditari,</quote>
            etc. Qui augere opes ambit, peccatum negligit, more avium captus, cum escam terrenam avidus inspicit, quo stranguletur peccati laqueo, non agnoscit: cum quaelibet mundi bona desiderat, quae de futuro damna patiatur ignorat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-prov28-Dd1e196">
          <head xml:id="gom-prov28-Hd1e198">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-prov28-d1e200">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1111C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e204" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov28_28@1-3">Cum surrexerint impii.</quote>
            Eosdem homines, quos justos dicit, quia justi, creationis ordinem servant: Unde in Job de poenitente: <quote xml:id="gom-prov28-Qd1e207" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob33_27@1-5">Respiciet homines, et dicet, Peccavi</quote>. Quod est, Respiciet eos, qui naturam humanae creationis custodiunt, et se peccando jumentis assimilatos agnoscunt.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
